(7322175, 1143137, 177322, '<td valign="top">One would not think that chicken wire and wind-blown strands of vegetation could be so "mesmerizing," but this image is just that.  Most unique.  Eight from me.</td>', 'One would not think that chicken wire and wind-blown strands of vegetation could be so "mesmerizing," but this image is just that.  Most unique.  Eight from me.', '2015-03-01 11:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322177, 1142553, 177322, '<td valign="top">Holy moly!!  Had to chuckle at the tiny red handle of the snow shovel peeking about a break in that cliff of snow.  Great photojournalism shot.</td>', 'Holy moly!!  Had to chuckle at the tiny red handle of the snow shovel peeking about a break in that cliff of snow.  Great photojournalism shot.', '2015-03-01 11:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322179, 1143082, 177322, '<td valign="top">Powerful!</td>', 'Powerful!', '2015-03-01 11:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322194, 1142825, 177322, '<td valign="top">Nice high contrast.</td>', 'Nice high contrast.', '2015-03-01 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322195, 1142333, 177322, '<td valign="top">This would be an interesting 12 month study - same spot, same day of each month for one year. This lovely sepia tone works perfectly for the dead-of-winter blahs.  Nice work.</td>', 'This would be an interesting 12 month study - same spot, same day of each month for one year. This lovely sepia tone works perfectly for the dead-of-winter blahs.  Nice work.', '2015-03-01 12:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322197, 1143107, 177322, '<td valign="top">It all about who has control of the cat trap: the box!  Interesting study into cat psychology.  B&amp;W works well.</td>', 'It all about who has control of the cat trap: the box!  Interesting study into cat psychology.  B&W works well.', '2015-03-01 12:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322201, 1142903, 177322, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  Spectacular stop-action shot.</td>', 'Yikes!  Spectacular stop-action shot.', '2015-03-01 12:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322237, 1143024, 177322, '<td valign="top">Interesting treatment.</td>', 'Interesting treatment.', '2015-03-01 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322243, 1142741, 177322, '<td valign="top">Exceptional capture.  Bravo!</td>', 'Exceptional capture.  Bravo!', '2015-03-01 15:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322244, 1143145, 177322, '<td valign="top">Tricky focus to get past those plants and get the sharpness you did on the eye.  Stunning capture of this regal creature. Double digit rating from me.</td>', 'Tricky focus to get past those plants and get the sharpness you did on the eye.  Stunning capture of this regal creature. Double digit rating from me.', '2015-03-01 15:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322277, 1142848, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so exquisite.  Like a canvas painting.</td>', 'This is so exquisite.  Like a canvas painting.', '2015-03-01 16:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322309, 1143002, 91730, '<td valign="top">the right side of her face seems a little blown out. otherwise a good portrait.</td>', 'the right side of her face seems a little blown out. otherwise a good portrait.', '2015-03-01 17:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322312, 1142789, 91730, '<td valign="top">I think it would have more appeal to me if more than her face was in focus. The dress is obviously a big part of the subject but i can''t make out any detail in it.</td>', 'I think it would have more appeal to me if more than her face was in focus. The dress is obviously a big part of the subject but i can''t make out any detail in it.', '2015-03-01 17:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322313, 1143149, 91730, '<td valign="top">Great picture!</td>', 'Great picture!', '2015-03-01 18:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322315, 1143126, 17837, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the use of the reflections in the water, however I feel like this image would be stronger if something was in strong focus. It appears that everything seems to be soft, whether that be through editing or a shallow dof.</td>', 'I enjoy the use of the reflections in the water, however I feel like this image would be stronger if something was in strong focus. It appears that everything seems to be soft, whether that be through editing or a shallow dof.', '2015-03-01 18:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322317, 1143164, 17837, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes that are presented, but I feel like the noise is too much for this type of photograph. A cleaner image would present much better. I also think you could crop most of the left side out, about a half inch past the shiny object.</td>', 'I like the shapes that are presented, but I feel like the noise is too much for this type of photograph. A cleaner image would present much better. I also think you could crop most of the left side out, about a half inch past the shiny object.', '2015-03-01 18:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322318, 1143028, 17837, '<td valign="top">What kind of bath is this?!? This image would be AWESOME with a few small changes. I can see your reflection in the child''s eyes. Also, the reflection in his eyes of the top of the tub almost cuts his eyes in half and I feel is very distracting. With those changes, I feel this would be a 8-9 image.</td>', 'What kind of bath is this?!? This image would be AWESOME with a few small changes. I can see your reflection in the child''s eyes. Also, the reflection in his eyes of the top of the tub almost cuts his eyes in half and I feel is very distracting. With those changes, I feel this would be a 8-9 image.', '2015-03-01 18:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322319, 1143145, 17837, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture of a snowy owl. great exposure. The branches are distracting but not much can be done about that! Great job.</td>', 'Awesome capture of a snowy owl. great exposure. The branches are distracting but not much can be done about that! Great job.', '2015-03-01 18:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322320, 1142853, 17837, '<td valign="top">Love the use of long exposure here to get the moving clouds. other than cropping a little on the bottom to present more of a foreground, I think you nailed it.</td>', 'Love the use of long exposure here to get the moving clouds. other than cropping a little on the bottom to present more of a foreground, I think you nailed it.', '2015-03-01 18:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322321, 1143148, 17837, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming that this is a double exposure, in which case I have a hard time understanding how both images relate to one another. I applaud you for trying different techniques though!</td>', 'I''m assuming that this is a double exposure, in which case I have a hard time understanding how both images relate to one another. I applaud you for trying different techniques though!', '2015-03-01 18:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322327, 1142789, 17837, '<td valign="top">I feel like having more of the dress in focus would make this image stronger.</td>', 'I feel like having more of the dress in focus would make this image stronger.', '2015-03-01 18:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322328, 1143158, 17837, '<td valign="top">Love the image.</td>', 'Love the image.', '2015-03-01 18:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322330, 1142848, 17837, '<td valign="top">everything about this image is fantastic, except for the boat streak. Edit that out and I feel like this is a 10. Also, I think if perhaps you turned down the lights it would enhance the image.</td>', 'everything about this image is fantastic, except for the boat streak. Edit that out and I feel like this is a 10. Also, I think if perhaps you turned down the lights it would enhance the image.', '2015-03-01 18:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322331, 1142486, 17837, '<td valign="top">great action shot. I think you could crop the bottom out a bit and it would be even more impacting.</td>', 'great action shot. I think you could crop the bottom out a bit and it would be even more impacting.', '2015-03-01 18:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322332, 1142846, 17837, '<td valign="top">this is a good capture. My eye struggles to find a center of interest though. I also believe a different time of day would make this image really pop, as the sun directly over head is distracting.</td>', 'this is a good capture. My eye struggles to find a center of interest though. I also believe a different time of day would make this image really pop, as the sun directly over head is distracting.', '2015-03-01 18:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322333, 1142989, 17837, '<td valign="top">awesome. Just awesome.</td>', 'awesome. Just awesome.', '2015-03-01 18:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322334, 1142817, 17837, '<td valign="top">cool image but I think the editing went a bit over board. She looks like a doll. Tone it down and I think you have a beautiful image.</td>', 'cool image but I think the editing went a bit over board. She looks like a doll. Tone it down and I think you have a beautiful image.', '2015-03-01 18:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322335, 1143149, 17837, '<td valign="top">Cool image. what a fantastic building to photograph. I would use a smaller aperture so that all of the building is in focus. I would also clone out the branches on the left side as I feel like those are distracting.</td>', 'Cool image. what a fantastic building to photograph. I would use a smaller aperture so that all of the building is in focus. I would also clone out the branches on the left side as I feel like those are distracting.', '2015-03-01 19:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322336, 1143171, 17837, '<td valign="top">very cool image. If this were shot on a tripod (I suspect it wasn''t), it would improve the image greatly for several reasons. <br/> <br/>It appears you have the ISO cranked way up, leading to incredible amounts of un-needed noise. Also, the focal plane seems to be on the tree, and the bench/man seem to be OOF. With a smaller aperture, you could focus on the bench and have everything remain in focus. Good attempt!</td>', 'very cool image. If this were shot on a tripod (I suspect it wasn''t), it would improve the image greatly for several reasons.  It appears you have the ISO cranked way up, leading to incredible amounts of un-needed noise. Also, the focal plane seems to be on the tree, and the bench/man seem to be OOF. With a smaller aperture, you could focus on the bench and have everything remain in focus. Good attempt!', '2015-03-01 19:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322337, 1142890, 17837, '<td valign="top">excellent image. I don''t agree with the tone, however Im just being nitpicky.</td>', 'excellent image. I don''t agree with the tone, however Im just being nitpicky.', '2015-03-01 19:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322338, 1142169, 17837, '<td valign="top">A great image for conversion. fantastic!</td>', 'A great image for conversion. fantastic!', '2015-03-01 19:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322339, 1142275, 17837, '<td valign="top">very nice studio capture</td>', 'very nice studio capture', '2015-03-01 19:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322340, 1142843, 17837, '<td valign="top">I like the artistry here. I love the use of the reflection without seeing the actual subjects. I think B+W would really set it off.</td>', 'I like the artistry here. I love the use of the reflection without seeing the actual subjects. I think B+W would really set it off.', '2015-03-01 19:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7322344, 1143117, 17837, '<td valign="top">I get it, but I don''t get it.</td>', 'I get it, but I don''t get it.', '2015-03-01 19:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
