(7322401, 1143185, 177322, '<td valign="top">Perfectly spaced, stepped birds, wispy clouds, good coloring, sharp - all lend to an interesting image.  Just wish that water could have been a little more level; a pesky detail I have to be mindful of myself. Still, worthy of a five.  Well seen. Good luck.</td>', 'Perfectly spaced, stepped birds, wispy clouds, good coloring, sharp - all lend to an interesting image.  Just wish that water could have been a little more level; a pesky detail I have to be mindful of myself. Still, worthy of a five.  Well seen. Good luck.', '2015-03-01 22:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
