(7323604, 1142848, 124815, '<td valign="top">A touch too slick and clinical for Venice in my opinion. To me Venice is more murky and surely ghostly. I much preferred your Cannaregio shot (hope I am not mistaken the photographer).<br/> <br/>Looking forward for more of your take of this amazing place</td>', 'A touch too slick and clinical for Venice in my opinion. To me Venice is more murky and surely ghostly. I much preferred your Cannaregio shot (hope I am not mistaken the photographer). Looking forward for more of your take of this amazing place', '2015-03-04 22:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
