(7324041, 1143127, 97225, '<td valign="top">The sea is fantastic, the sky is fantastic. The halo along the top of the land pretty much spoils it. You can eliminate bright halos by using  your clone tool on a small brush setting, and in darken mode, and sampling  the adjacent sky and cloning over the bright bit all the way along - resampling as you go. It wont affect the darker land area.</td>', 'The sea is fantastic, the sky is fantastic. The halo along the top of the land pretty much spoils it. You can eliminate bright halos by using  your clone tool on a small brush setting, and in darken mode, and sampling  the adjacent sky and cloning over the bright bit all the way along - resampling as you go. It wont affect the darker land area.', '2015-03-06 05:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
