(7325175, 1143050, 147314, '<td valign="top">Thanks Paul, this is Sligachan on the Isle of Sky. When you look on the map, it''s on the point where the A87 and the A863 comes together. It''s here where you have a great view on the Cuillins, both the Red Hills (the mountains you see in the image) and the Black Cuilins (to the right, not visible on this image). A very photo genetic place..</td>', 'Thanks Paul, this is Sligachan on the Isle of Sky. When you look on the map, it''s on the point where the A87 and the A863 comes together. It''s here where you have a great view on the Cuillins, both the Red Hills (the mountains you see in the image) and the Black Cuilins (to the right, not visible on this image). A very photo genetic place..', '2015-03-08 04:56:38.000000', NULL, 0),
