(7325222, 1142789, 83149, '<td valign="top">You have a pretty model and a nice pose.<br/> <br/>On the down side, the dress needs to be in better focus and the cropping of the lower legs looks awkward.  I think it would have worked better if you either included the full body, or cropped somewhere around the waist and had her other hand moved up into frame.<br/> <br/>I find the smile looks kind of forced and the lighting around the lips doesn''t help either.</td>', 'You have a pretty model and a nice pose. On the down side, the dress needs to be in better focus and the cropping of the lower legs looks awkward.  I think it would have worked better if you either included the full body, or cropped somewhere around the waist and had her other hand moved up into frame. I find the smile looks kind of forced and the lighting around the lips doesn''t help either.', '2015-03-08 09:15:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7325228, 1142904, 23098, '<td valign="top">I like this, stopped me at every pass... the colors, shadows and your vision.</td>', 'I like this, stopped me at every pass... the colors, shadows and your vision.', '2015-03-08 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
