(7325234, 1141381, 19825, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ecmguy:</b></div><hr/><i> I''ll be a lot more careful and do significantly more training on the next drone :) And maybe stop flying it over water... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Glad you''ve gotten your replacement drone off the ground again. So much for not flying over water...<br/> <br/>I look forward to more drone shots.</td>', 'Originally posted by ecmguy: I''ll be a lot more careful and do significantly more training on the next drone :) And maybe stop flying it over water...  Glad you''ve gotten your replacement drone off the ground again. So much for not flying over water... I look forward to more drone shots.', '2015-03-08 10:10:46.000000', NULL, 0),
