(7325256, 1143043, 63218, '<td valign="top">Simple.  Peaceful. Restful. I like the relaxed sharp focus &amp; restrained palette of soft colors &amp; gave it a 9 because of the smoky look, which flattened the contrast a little bit.</td>', 'Simple.  Peaceful. Restful. I like the relaxed sharp focus & restrained palette of soft colors & gave it a 9 because of the smoky look, which flattened the contrast a little bit.', '2015-03-08 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
