(7325276, 1142848, 113016, '<td valign="top">beautifully crisp throughout!  wonderful!  Congratulations.  Much deserved Blue. <br/> <br/>*visited the montage.  WONDERFUL!! WONDERFUL!! WONDERFUL imagery!  All your work is so inspiring.  If I can suggest, for your next montage, to consider not using page-turn or similar transitions.  In my humble opinion, they cheapen the images.  Slow dissolves (like you''ve done later in the pc) produce so much more emotion (and fit the music).  My guess is it''s animoto or similar with no timeline control, so you''re kind of at the mercy of the software and transition lengths.  I find no better way to expose my images than thru these montages.</td>', 'beautifully crisp throughout!  wonderful!  Congratulations.  Much deserved Blue.  *visited the montage.  WONDERFUL!! WONDERFUL!! WONDERFUL imagery!  All your work is so inspiring.  If I can suggest, for your next montage, to consider not using page-turn or similar transitions.  In my humble opinion, they cheapen the images.  Slow dissolves (like you''ve done later in the pc) produce so much more emotion (and fit the music).  My guess is it''s animoto or similar with no timeline control, so you''re kind of at the mercy of the software and transition lengths.  I find no better way to expose my images than thru these montages.', '2015-03-08 13:12:56.000000', NULL, 0),
