(7325346, 1142901, 60173, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Catherine_B:</b></div><hr/><i> Interesting image.  The door and the window are great frames and the pose of the nude draws one in.  Makes you wonder what the story is... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Makes me wonder what she''s trying to sniff, lol.</td>', 'Originally posted by Catherine_B: Interesting image.  The door and the window are great frames and the pose of the nude draws one in.  Makes you wonder what the story is...   Makes me wonder what she''s trying to sniff, lol.', '2015-03-08 18:05:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7325374, 1143021, 60495, '<td valign="top">Not sure how I left a blank comment but here is what I was likely thinking... I would say these are a curse, it always amazes me how big these things really are and to me they are an eyesore. Every type of energy has a drawback and a price to the environment and I am not convinced the payback is worth the cost for these. As for the photo, it has nice leading lines and the hazy day adds some interest but my overall interest in the subject is just not there, I would likely have scored it in the 5-6 range.</td>', 'Not sure how I left a blank comment but here is what I was likely thinking... I would say these are a curse, it always amazes me how big these things really are and to me they are an eyesore. Every type of energy has a drawback and a price to the environment and I am not convinced the payback is worth the cost for these. As for the photo, it has nice leading lines and the hazy day adds some interest but my overall interest in the subject is just not there, I would likely have scored it in the 5-6 range.', '2015-03-08 18:36:19.000000', NULL, 0),
